1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,200
Hello.

2
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:06,160
Hey, Yong Qi

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,320
requesting backup.

4
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,519
The young master can't
take it anymore, huh?

5
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:10,520
Then come back here.

6
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:11,640
Nah, that's not it.

7
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,840
Xu Feiyu's pretty happy with me.

8
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:16,599
He just gave me a 500-yuan raise.

9
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,520
Song Yi, don't pull anything.

10
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,719
And most of all

11
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:21,839
no physical contact with him whatsoever.

12
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:22,840
Relax

13
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:23,919
I know my limits.

14
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:27,160
To me he's just a little brother I can handle.

15
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:32,320
But the way to a little brother's
heart is through his stomach

16
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,400
Song Yi?

17
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:08,360
Song Yi?

18
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:18,679
Boss.

19
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:20,079
You finally came out.

20
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,080
Song Yi.

21
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:23,760
Why are you still here?

22
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:26,160
Even if I do leave

23
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,720
I'd do it on proper terms.

24
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:30,159
Getting slapped and walking out

25
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:31,320
isn't my style.

26
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,120
Did you make all of this?

27
00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:34,920
Yeah.

28
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:36,439
This whole table of food

29
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:37,800
took a lot of work.

30
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:39,960
You want to

31
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:40,960
try some?

32
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:46,320
Okay.

33
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:47,720
Careful.

34
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,400
This one's soup.

35
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:23,560
There.

36
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,560
Eat up.

37
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:32,600
Mm.

38
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:34,040
So good.

39
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:38,440
Mm.

40
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:42,480
Delicious.

41
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:48,600
Ah, well.

42
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,680
Let me walk you through it.

43
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,160
This one here

44
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,000
is sweet and sour ribs.

45
00:02:58,760 --> 00:02:59,520
This one

46
00:02:59,521 --> 00:03:00,880
is braised beef.

47
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:03,440
And this one

48
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:05,160
is spicy stir-fried cabbage.

49
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:06,640
And this one

50
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:08,360
is Osaka kimchi.

51
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:10,000
There's Osaka kimchi too?

52
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:10,760
Mm-hm.

53
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,200
My secret recipe kimchi.

54
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,360
Try some.

55
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,320
Well?

56
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:25,520
Is it good?

57
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,120
Mm.

58
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:42,240
Good, right?

59
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:51,440
Xu Feiyu.

60
00:03:52,320 --> 00:03:53,720
Are you always like this?

61
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,199
What kind of person

62
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:57,959
could ever manage looking after you?

63
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,120
Tell me.

64
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,560
Maybe I could even find you one.

65
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:04,000
Please just eat.

66
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,920
So you think I talk too much...?

67
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,240
All right

68
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:11,480
I'll shut up then.

69
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:13,280
Take your time.

70
00:04:16,400 --> 00:04:17,480
Of everything on this table

71
00:04:17,880 --> 00:04:20,120
only this "Osaka kimchi" is what you made yourself?

72
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:23,360
You doubt me?

73
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:26,080
There is no need to doubt.

74
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,520
I grew tired of Yong Qi's food long ago.

75
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:29,840
Somewhere else next time.

76
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,440
Sure.

77
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:43,199
Water's just right.

78
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:44,200
You can get in now.

79
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,000
Here we are.

80
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:03,520
Well?

81
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:04,960
Is the water okay?

82
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,120
Mm.

83
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:07,960
Be careful then.

84
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:13,240
Want me to help you undress?

85
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:15,160
Get out.

86
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:27,040
Oh right.

87
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:29,080
Your safety is my responsibility.

88
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:31,560
Just get out of here!

89
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:36,279
I've got everything you've got.

90
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:37,559
Afraid I'll peek?

91
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,160
Hey.

92
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:39,960
You're the one who kicked me out.

93
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:41,080
If anything happens,

94
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,120
don't blame me.

95
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,720
Ahh!

96
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,280
Ugh.

97
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:47,280
Xu Feiyu!

98
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,080
Ngh!

99
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:48,760
Ugh.

100
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:50,000
Mm— ah.

101
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:50,880
Ugh.

102
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:52,160
Are you okay?

103
00:05:52,161 --> 00:05:53,399
Don't touch me.

104
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:54,400
Don't move!

105
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:07,480
I'll set it here — don't move.

106
00:06:20,440 --> 00:06:21,600
Agh! Hss—.

107
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:25,920
Hss—.

108
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:09,720
Anywhere else hurt?

109
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:12,960
Come on, talk to me.

110
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:15,320
Say it.

111
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:16,440
Tell me.

112
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:23,280
Let me take a look.

113
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,040
Hss— It's fine.

114
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:24,560
Hey.

115
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,560
Just let me see.

116
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:26,880
Okay.

117
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:28,160
Hold still.

118
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:34,760
Strangely enough

119
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:38,920
he touches me and I'm not allergic anymore.

120
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:41,519
It doesn't feel bad either

121
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:44,000
I'm even a little happy.

122
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:47,560
A comforting feeling of being cared for.

123
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:51,160
I've never felt this before.

124
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:52,200
Hss— ah.

125
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:11,600
How's that?

126
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,720
Still hurt?

127
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:15,200
No.

128
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:15,760
No.

129
00:08:15,761 --> 00:08:16,920
It doesn't hurt.

130
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:18,720
From now on

131
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:20,760
don't go wandering out of my sight.

132
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,040
Hm?

133
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:27,120
Huh?

134
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,800
What are you doing?

135
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,160
Little brother

136
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:33,960
you never do as you're told.

137
00:08:35,040 --> 00:08:36,080
From now on, big brother's

138
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:38,200
gonna have to be tougher on you.

139
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:40,360
You're out of your mind.

140
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:49,120
Ooh, such fair skin
on those calves.

141
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:50,920
Hm?

142
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,600
Hss—.

143
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:01,760
What are you up to now.

144
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,359
In your condition

145
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,520
you need 24-hour care.

146
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:06,360
So.

147
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:07,520
I'll sleep in your room

148
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:08,919
so I'm right there for you.

149
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:10,079
Song Yi!

150
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,600
Don't push your luck!

151
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:14,160
You don't enter my room without permission.

152
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,720
Then

153
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,160
for your own safety

154
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:20,400
there's only one thing to do.

155
00:09:23,160 --> 00:09:24,400
What are you doing?

156
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:34,280
Ngh— what is that?

157
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:46,040
What—.

158
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:47,160
Hold still.

159
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:14,520
How's the tension?

160
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:15,760
Does it dig in?

161
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:17,960
All that fuss

162
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:19,320
and this is it?

163
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:21,280
Don't underestimate this.

164
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,200
I'll take the couch.

165
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:24,320
Anything at night,

166
00:10:24,321 --> 00:10:25,520
just pull the cord

167
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,560
I promise I'll be right there.

168
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:29,040
This is ridiculous.

169
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:31,400
What's ridiculous about it?

170
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:32,879
If you dare take it off,

171
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:34,200
I'll tie it to your neck.

172
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:37,640
Mm.

173
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:38,800
Fine.

174
00:10:51,640 --> 00:10:52,640
Good night.

175
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:55,480
Your big brother's on call anytime.

176
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:10,240
Get up.

177
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,520
Song Yi, get up.

178
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:16,000
Song Yi, wake up!

179
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:22,640
Get up.

180
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:23,640
Oh, you're awake.

181
00:13:24,560 --> 00:13:25,560
Song Yi

182
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:26,920
I need the bathroom.

183
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:39,120
Mm.

184
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:40,120
Ah— agh!

185
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:42,040
Agh!

186
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:44,120
Ugh.

187
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:44,720
Agh!

188
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:45,240
Mm.

189
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:45,760
Ah.

190
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:47,920
Aah— agh!

191
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:52,920
Song Yi!

192
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:02,320
I knew you wouldn't last long,

193
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:04,840
but I never thought you'd run away.

194
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,360
Met your match this time, huh?

195
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:09,640
All right.

196
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:12,000
You've had your fun—go back to Singapore.

197
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:14,520
At least sit your finals.

198
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:19,600
I've still got things to do

199
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:22,280
I'm not going back until it's done.

200
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:25,359
Didn't you say you were
looking for someone?

201
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:26,800
Now it's something to do?

202
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:39,200
Feiyu's house?

203
00:14:41,240 --> 00:14:43,360
So this is Mr. Song.

204
00:14:44,520 --> 00:14:46,480
And the kid next to him?

205
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:48,400
Yeah.

206
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:49,920
So the one you're looking for...

207
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:55,120
But I don't get it.

208
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:57,879
As far as I know, Mr. Song never

209
00:14:57,880 --> 00:14:59,040
went looking for Feiyu.

210
00:14:59,560 --> 00:15:01,280
So why are you looking for him?

211
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:05,960
Since I was little,

212
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:10,040
my old man loved me
more than my real father.

213
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:11,480
But

214
00:15:11,560 --> 00:15:13,400
it was like he saw someone else in me.

215
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:16,759
Back then, every time he drank

216
00:15:16,760 --> 00:15:18,400
he'd call me by the wrong name.

217
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:20,520
So.

218
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:22,960
I always wanted to meet him.

219
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:25,280
So

220
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:27,320
you think you're a replacement?

221
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:32,080
Song Yi, you're not that fragile, are you?

222
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:39,920
So now that you've met him,

223
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,120
how do you feel?

224
00:15:43,680 --> 00:15:44,800
He's a handful!

225
00:15:45,920 --> 00:15:47,240
A handful?

226
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:48,640
Yeah, he really is!

227
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:53,400
Feiyu doesn't know, does he?

228
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:56,800
I don't plan on telling him.

229
00:15:56,880 --> 00:15:57,880
That's good.

230
00:15:58,560 --> 00:16:00,680
At least you've got some sense left.

231
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:05,720
Until I figure out what to do,

232
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:07,999
he won't know a thing.

233
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,799
I'm guardian to the both of you.

234
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:12,200
Once you've worked
it out, you tell me first.

235
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:14,160
Otherwise, if something blows up,

236
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:15,320
I'm responsible.

237
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:17,640
You're way too nosy.

238
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:18,840
Right?

239
00:16:19,160 --> 00:16:19,440
Come on

240
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:20,760
let's drink!

241
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:21,160
Enough.

242
00:16:21,161 --> 00:16:22,199
Stop drinking.

243
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:23,759
Just get yourself home.

244
00:16:23,760 --> 00:16:25,320
Leaving Feiyu home alone like that—

245
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,599
if anything happens

246
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:27,800
I'll never forgive you.

247
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:30,879
I do want to go back…

248
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:31,880
but he…

249
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:38,880
Feiyu.

250
00:16:39,577 --> 00:16:40,816
Xu Feiyu!

251
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:42,639
I'm not drunk. Let go.

252
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:43,000
Yes? What is it?

253
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:45,279
Song Yi's had too much to drink.

254
00:16:45,280 --> 00:16:46,280
Give me a hand.

255
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:47,360
Ugh.

256
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:48,360
Easy.

257
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:50,799
You— the sofa's behind you.

258
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:51,360
Easy now.

259
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:52,360
Not drunk.

260
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:53,200
Okay.

261
00:16:53,201 --> 00:16:54,600
There we go— the sofa.

262
00:16:55,160 --> 00:16:57,000
Oh, honestly.

263
00:16:57,360 --> 00:16:58,520
Feiyu.

264
00:16:58,840 --> 00:17:00,080
Song Yi's drunk,

265
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:01,040
and it's so late,

266
00:17:01,160 --> 00:17:03,959
and I'm a woman on my own— it's awkward.

267
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:06,160
Just let him stay the night here.

268
00:17:07,080 --> 00:17:08,720
I don't take in drunks.

269
00:17:09,560 --> 00:17:11,439
Just one night

270
00:17:11,440 --> 00:17:12,880
I'll come get him tomorrow.

271
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,800
Think of it as helping me out

272
00:17:19,280 --> 00:17:21,399
(drunken mumbling)

273
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:22,400
Fine, then.

274
00:17:22,600 --> 00:17:23,400
Great.

275
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:24,200
Thanks, then.

276
00:17:24,201 --> 00:17:25,440
Look after him. I'm off.

277
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:38,120
Done acting?

278
00:17:38,280 --> 00:17:39,280
Ah— ow.

279
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:46,960
Xu Feiyu.

280
00:17:47,560 --> 00:17:49,000
How'd you know I wasn't drunk?

281
00:17:50,080 --> 00:17:52,320
A drunk person goes limp.

282
00:17:53,280 --> 00:17:54,480
You were way too stiff.

283
00:17:57,280 --> 00:17:58,600
Clever, aren't you!

284
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:04,400
If the drink's worn off,

285
00:18:04,560 --> 00:18:05,800
you may go now.

286
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:08,959
People like you, with no
shame and no boundaries,

287
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:10,920
are truly unpleasant.

288
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:15,440
Xu Feiyu.

289
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:16,880
Is this necessary?

290
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:20,400
Why bristle at everyone like a hedgehog?

291
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:23,040
The world doesn't revolve around you.

292
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:26,960
Did your dad walk out

293
00:18:27,520 --> 00:18:28,520
because of you?

294
00:18:29,280 --> 00:18:30,560
Did you lash out at him too?

295
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:32,640
Hm?

296
00:18:34,080 --> 00:18:35,080
Hm?

297
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:37,760
Get out!

